Adds a small IPC for external bars: kwm writes the current output's tags and
focused window to $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kwm/state.json whenever its own bar would
redraw, and takes tag and focus commands from the fifo
$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kwm/control (see src/kwm/ipc.zig).

